      "content": "but saying \"it doesn't define my worth\" doesn't change the reality. the reality is she has to work more hours just to cover my stuff and i just sit here. it's not just a feeling, it's a fact. i look at her and i just see how much harder her life is because i'm in it. it feels selfish to even be alive right now.",
