    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say value is intrinsic but i don't see the logic in it. if i'm a net negative in her life, isn't it more compassionate to just stop being the cause of it? like, if i wasn't here, she wouldn't have to struggle. it feels like the only way to actually be selfless is to go away.",
